## 3. PRODUCT PITCH

RentFlow lets landlords and property agencies manage properties, tenants, leases, rent collection, and maintenance on their own computer — online or offline — replacing spreadsheets and paper ledgers.

**Core promise:** *"Know who owes what, which units are empty, and what needs fixing, in under 10 seconds from opening the app."*

**Personas:** independent landlord (1–15 units), agency manager (50–500 units), property owner (read-only recipient of statements), accountant (needs exports).

**Non-goals v1:** web app, mobile app, tenant/vendor logins, online payment processing, full double-entry accounting, tax filing.

