## 10. DRIVE SYNC — ENCRYPTED, OFFLINE-TOLERANT

Same layout as before:

```
manifest.json.enc
devices/<device-uuid>.json.enc
changes/<device-uuid>/000001.json.enc
snapshots/2026-10-29T18-30-00Z.sqlite.enc
meta.json.enc
```

Argon2id (t=3, m=64MB, p=4) → 32B master → HKDF per file → AES-256-GCM. Never upload plaintext.

**Sync engine:** runs on open + every 30s focused + on write (debounced 2s). Push batches of 500, pull remote changes, merge with last-write-wins except payments/invoices which are append-only (conflict screen for edits to totals). Snapshots rotate 7 daily / 4 weekly.

**Offline matrix:** all app features work offline; only sign-in, sync, and messenger deep links need network. Status indicator in top bar.

